{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "e88c823b938e36786f60a11e553fc99705867b9a3957de159fb72db4352f40d1", "documents": [{"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, {"id": "offline-e88c823b938e36786f60", "filename": "9-Part C.mp3", "sha256": "e88c823b938e36786f60a11e553fc99705867b9a3957de159fb72db4352f40d1", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/e88c823b938e36786f60a11e553fc99705867b9a3957de159fb72db4352f40d1.mp3", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/e88c823b938e36786f60a11e553fc99705867b9a3957de159fb72db4352f40d1.json", "format": "mp3", "role": "recording"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1RTCgPQXPfPBb9cHIgQAVfTz0wyw_zygE-C-0", "label": "Jahshan set 9 · Part C", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [111, 112, 113, 114], "questions": [{"number": 31, "prompt": "Dr Dean says that patients with tennis elbow\nA may be unaware that they have the condition at first.\nB tend to come from a remarkably narrow range of occupations.\nC can easily avoid the condition by adopting correct working practices.", "sourcePage": 111, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 32, "prompt": "In the physiotherapy programme used in Dr Dean’s trial,\nA the treatment given was tailored to the needs of each patient.\nB patients had to build up their strength before starting it.\nC some patients found the treatment too painful.", "sourcePage": 111, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 33, "prompt": "What does Dr Dean say about the role of ‘smart rest’ in the trial?\nA It wasn’t appropriate for certain types of tennis elbow.\nB It formed the basis of two of the three treatment options.\nC It kept all patients physically active despite the condition.", "sourcePage": 111, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 34, "prompt": "What did Dr Dean find interesting about the results of the trial?\nA They were surprisingly conclusive in the short term.\nB They underlined the advantages of timely intervention.\nC They confirmed the findings of an earlier piece of research.", "sourcePage": 112, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 35, "prompt": "Dr Dean would advise anyone experiencing tennis elbow for more than three months to\nA avoid using any steroid-based medication at that point.\nB be ready to start more invasive forms of treatment.\nC try a combination of physiotherapy and injections.", "sourcePage": 112, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 36, "prompt": "Dr Dean suggests that taking anti-inflammatories for tennis elbow\nA is less effective than alternative forms of medication.\nB is trying to treat a symptom that may not actually exist.\nC is an area that needs to be researched more thoroughly.\nNow look at extract two.\n\nExtract 2: Questions 37-42\nYou hear a presentation in which a researcher called Dr Sarah Jones is talking on the subject of weight loss\ninterventions by GPs.\nYou now have 90 seconds to read questions 37-42.", "sourcePage": 112, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 37, "prompt": "Dr Jones suggests that few health professionals currently attempt weight loss interventions\nbecause they\nA have often found them to be ineffective.\nB lack confidence in the chances of success.\nC rarely have time to spare for non-clinical issues.", "sourcePage": 113, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "The specific aim of the trial Dr Jones describes was\nA to draw patients’ attention to the need to lose weight.\nB to reduce the time that weight-loss interventions take.\nC to promote greater understanding of the dangers of obesity.", "sourcePage": 113, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 39, "prompt": "Dr Jones now feels practitioners can justify weight loss interventions because\nA patients are currently less sensitive about weight-related issues.\nB a huge majority of patients feel that it is a suitable topic for discussion.\nC circumstances demand that action is taken even if patients are reluctant.", "sourcePage": 113, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 40, "prompt": "When describing the trialling of the programme, Dr Jones says she was surprised by\nA the fact that most patients offered a place did actually join it.\nB the positive attitude of patients who accepted the treatment.\nC the number of patients who dropped out early.", "sourcePage": 114, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 41, "prompt": "From the outcomes of the trial we learn that\nA the results for all participants improved at a similar rate.\nB intervention was consistently more successful than non-intervention.\nC the advantages of intervention became less marked in the longer term.", "sourcePage": 114, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 42, "prompt": "What does Dr Jones feel are the implications of the findings of the trial?\nA Areas other than weight loss may be suitable for similar initiatives.\nB Doctors may find that their role in the community starts to change.\nC There could be widespread benefits if they were applied nationally.\nYou now have two minutes to check your answers.\nTHAT IS THE END OF THE LISTENING TEST", "sourcePage": 114, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["e88c823b938e36786f60a11e553fc99705867b9a3957de159fb72db4352f40d1"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
